{{! RAP template fork - ADR-SDK-023 maintained surface, documented in pipeline/typescript/config.yaml. Upstream defect (2026-08-27, spec v2.4.0 re-pin): the stock router sends anyOf composed models through modelGeneric, which merges every branch's properties into one interface and treats a branch's required members as unconditionally present, so decoding any body that lacks them throws (e.g. a single TransactionResponse body crashing on the group envelope's required transactions array). This fork adds an anyOf route to modelAnyOf, which generates the same union-type + ordered instanceOf discrimination shape the oneOf route produces. Raise upstream at the next generator-pin revision. This comment stays free of braces by rule. }}
